Material: {"source_context":[{"end":2244,"id":"S000","reason":"existing-evidence","roles":["scope_text:0"],"start":2025,"text":"(iii) Notwithstanding any other requirement of this chapter, occupy an approved child restraint system furnished by the operator or one of the persons described in paragraph (a)(3)(iii)(A) of this section provided that:"},{"end":2557,"id":"S001","reason":"focus-or-structural-adjacent","roles":["scope_text:1"],"start":2413,"text":"(B) Except as provided in paragraph (a)(3)(iii)(B)( 4 ) of this action, the approved child restraint system bears one or more labels as follows:"},{"end":2767,"id":"S002","reason":"focus-or-structural-adjacent","roles":["summary","scope_text:2"],"start":2559,"text":"( 1 ) Seats manufactured to U.S. standards between January 1, 1981, and February 25, 1985, must bear the label: “This child restraint system conforms to all applicable Federal motor vehicle safety standards”;"},{"end":2654,"id":"S003","reason":"existing-evidence","roles":["modality"],"start":2650,"text":"must"},{"end":2864,"id":"S004","reason":"focus-or-structural-adjacent","start":2769,"text":"( 2 ) Seats manufactured to U.S. standards on or after February 26, 1985, must bear two labels:"}],"statement":"Seats manufactured to U.S. standards between January 1, 1981, and February 25, 1985, must bear the label: “This child restraint system conforms to all applicable Federal motor vehicle safety standards”."}
